format 1
adapter feed 1
npc: npc-kofi

post ft-kofi-chest-daily
kind: celebrate
trigger: chest_opened
chip: quests
condition: {"period":"daily"}

text:
    Daily chest, opened! Small reward, solid habit. That is how you build something.

post ft-kofi-chest-weekly
kind: celebrate
trigger: chest_opened
chip: quests
condition: {"period":"weekly"}

text:
    Weekly chest is open. Every quest of the week bolted into place, brick by brick. Solid work.

post ft-kofi-first-lesson
kind: celebrate
trigger: first_lesson
chip: lesson

text:
    First lesson done: “{lesson}”! That is the foundation poured. Now we build on it.

post ft-kofi-quests
kind: celebrate
trigger: daily_quests_done
chip: quests

text:
    Every daily quest is claimed! That is a full day's work. Open the chest, you earned it.

post ft-kofi-rank-passed
kind: celebrate
trigger: rank_change
chip: ranks
condition: {"direction":"passed"}

text:
    You passed {rival} in the weekly ranking! Nice push. Keep that engine running.

post ft-kofi-comeback-14
kind: nudge
trigger: comeback
condition: {"minDays":14}

text:
    Long time, {name}. No problem. Every project has a pause. Let's restart with one good lesson.

post ft-kofi-comeback-3
kind: nudge
trigger: comeback
condition: {"minDays":3}

text:
    {name}, welcome back! Hard hat is on. Let's get back to work, one lesson at a time.

post ft-kofi-rank-passed-by
kind: nudge
trigger: rank_change
chip: ranks
condition: {"direction":"passed_by"}

text:
    {rival} passed you in the weekly ranking. Time to fire the engine back up. One lesson gets you moving.
